0..75 Comment "// A module sealed by a signature, after ML\'s opaque ascription (Harper and"
76..147 Comment "// Lillibridge, _A Type-Theoretic Approach to Higher-Order Modules with"
148..225 Comment "// Sharing_, POPL 1994, doi:10.1145/174675.176927): outside the seal its type"
226..298 Comment "// is abstract, so a value of it is reached only through the members the"
299..373 Comment "// signature exposes. A run answering one is opaque at the seal, since its"
374..405 Comment "// type is not marked `mobile`."
407..436 Comment "// The sealed counter `Seed`."
